{"data": {"node": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "8651560711564178", "organization": {"id": "1572883213617543", "viewer_permissions": [], "application_groupings": {"nodes": [{"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "8651560711564178"}]}, "id": "1071083901425949"}]}}, "firstRevision": {"nodes": [{"application": {"id": "8651560711564178", "release_date": 1787858820, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "27852171557743139"}, "id": "1470145710340083"}]}}, "binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "8651560711564178", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27852171557743139"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "id": "27852171557743139", "version": "1.11", "version_code": 8, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "live_binary": null, "created_date": 1732814709, "id": "8651560748230841", "is_initial_release": true, "name_with_fallback": "v1", "pdp_metadata_with_fallback": {"version": 1, "application": {"is_concept": false, "latest_released_pdp_metadata": {"id": "24436333162660346"}, "release_status": "RELEASED", "id": "8651560711564178"}, "id": "24436333162660346", "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "release_date": null, "administration_status": "APPROVED", "is_first": true, "release_status": "RELEASED", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "8651560711564178", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "3983563258569599"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2601587930195008", "locale": "cs_CZ", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "EduVR", "keywords": ["vzd\u011bl\u00e1n\u00ed", "\u0161kola", "d\u00edlny", "modern\u00ed"], "long_description": "## Revoluce ve vzd\u011bl\u00e1v\u00e1n\u00ed prost\u0159ednictv\u00edm virtu\u00e1ln\u00ed reality  \n\n**EduVR** je modul\u00e1rn\u00ed eduka\u010dn\u00ed VR aplikace navr\u017een\u00e1 pro \u0161koly, kter\u00e1 p\u0159in\u00e1\u0161\u00ed nov\u00fd zp\u016fsob, jak zapojit studenty do v\u00fduky. U\u010ditel\u00e9 i \u017e\u00e1ci se stanou sou\u010d\u00e1st\u00ed realistick\u00fdch simulac\u00ed a praktick\u00fdch \u00fakol\u016f, kter\u00e9 podporuj\u00ed aktivn\u00ed u\u010den\u00ed, bezpe\u010dn\u00e9 experimentov\u00e1n\u00ed a snadn\u011bj\u0161\u00ed pochopen\u00ed slo\u017eit\u00fdch t\u00e9mat.  \n\n---\n\n## **Kl\u00ed\u010dov\u00e9 vlastnosti**  \n\n- **Modul\u00e1rn\u00ed syst\u00e9m:** Pokr\u00fdv\u00e1 \u0161irokou \u0161k\u00e1lu p\u0159edm\u011bt\u016f a obor\u016f, s neust\u00e1le p\u0159ib\u00fdvaj\u00edc\u00edmi nov\u00fdmi moduly.  \n- **Snadn\u00e9 pou\u017eit\u00ed:** Nen\u00ed pot\u0159eba v\u00fdkonn\u00fd po\u010d\u00edta\u010d \u2013 EduVR b\u011b\u017e\u00ed p\u0159\u00edmo na Meta Quest.  \n- **Bezpe\u010dn\u00e9 u\u010den\u00ed:** Simulace situac\u00ed, kter\u00e9 nelze bezpe\u010dn\u011b prov\u00e9st v re\u00e1ln\u00e9 v\u00fduce (nap\u0159. BOZP).  \n- **Interaktivita:** \u00dakoly a simulace na 5\u201310 minut, ide\u00e1ln\u00ed pro za\u010dlen\u011bn\u00ed do b\u011b\u017en\u00e9 v\u00fduky.  \n- **Statistiky:** U\u010ditel\u00e9 mohou sledovat pokrok student\u016f a poskytovat zp\u011btnou vazbu.  \n\n---\n\n## **V\u00fdhody pro \u0161koly**  \n\n- **Atraktivn\u00ed forma v\u00fduky:** Virtu\u00e1ln\u00ed realita zvy\u0161uje z\u00e1jem \u017e\u00e1k\u016f o vzd\u011bl\u00e1n\u00ed a rozv\u00edj\u00ed jejich dovednosti.  \n- **\u00daspora n\u00e1klad\u016f:** Pro odborn\u00e9 \u0161koly mo\u017enost simulovat pr\u00e1ci s drah\u00fdmi materi\u00e1ly a p\u0159\u00edstroji.  \n- **Flexibilita:** P\u0159izp\u016fsobiteln\u00e9 pro r\u016fzn\u00e9 p\u0159edm\u011bty i v\u011bkov\u00e9 skupiny.  \n- **Praktick\u00e9 pou\u017eit\u00ed:** P\u0159\u00edprava student\u016f na re\u00e1ln\u00e9 situace bezpe\u010dn\u00fdm a efektivn\u00edm zp\u016fsobem.  \n\n---\n\n## **Vyzkou\u0161ejte zdarma**  \n\nSt\u00e1hn\u011bte si bezplatnou verzi EduVR, kter\u00e1 ka\u017ed\u00fdch 14 dn\u00ed zp\u0159\u00edstupn\u00ed nov\u00fd modul na vyzkou\u0161en\u00ed. Objevte, jak m\u016f\u017ee EduVR obohatit vzd\u011bl\u00e1v\u00e1n\u00ed na va\u0161\u00ed \u0161kole, a za\u010dn\u011bte je\u0161t\u011b dnes!  ", "short_description": "P\u0159ive\u010fte do sv\u00e9 t\u0159\u00eddy revoluci s EduVR, modul\u00e1rn\u00ed eduka\u010dn\u00ed VR aplikac\u00ed navr\u017eenou pro \u0161koly! Zapojte studenty do interaktivn\u00edch lekc\u00ed nap\u0159\u00ed\u010d r\u016fzn\u00fdmi p\u0159edm\u011bty s realistick\u00fdmi simulacemi, praktick\u00fdmi \u00fakoly a podrobnou zp\u011btnou vazbou. Nen\u00ed pot\u0159eba PC\u2014v\u0161e b\u011b\u017e\u00ed p\u0159\u00edmo na Meta Quest. Objevte nov\u00fd zp\u016fsob u\u010den\u00ed, \u0161et\u0159ete zdroje a probu\u010fte z\u00e1jem v ka\u017ed\u00e9m studentovi!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "hero_cover.png", "id": "1285614156052820", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982619_1285614159386153_9193819593370860177_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8csBWTxN9g4Q7kNvwE3ymfP&_nc_oc=AdpW9j5KInKrS7h_nY_0f-69hQvwww-OR1tyw7y13VBCUNTPVmVbnn-F17ucjWC-Z6I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL1gZ2Dwh4Qdceu9FmwK7kKC19Du-NOiuVk6jTl6Fa6kQ&oe=6A9ED1F7"}, {"file_name": "cover_1008x1440.png", "id": "596824689538812", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75462204_596824696205478_7016241178100153526_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid